  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora 3.0 (trunk) has added add/purgeRelationship methods to API-M.  We need to verify that these actions are journaled/replayable and appropriate tests exist in the journaling code for them.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Also, if there have been any local nsdl changes since the 2.2.1 release, we need to apply those to 3.0 and/or maintenance-2.2, as appropriate.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
